# ROOFCAT: passing a score milestone releases a paper lantern; hitting it is a 1UP.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat stage 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 0
wait 10
expect lanterns == 0
cheat score 3000
expect lanterns == 1
expect lives == 3
cheat put 150 40
wait 110
press B
press UP
wait 20
expect lives >= 3
